# Markdown Documentation

- Use UK English spelling.
- Do not use the em dash (U+2014). Use spaced ASCII hyphen ` - ` in prose; use a single `-` for empty UI placeholders (see `CONVENTIONS.md`).
- For general documentation, use the `project-documentation` skill in `.agents/skills/`.
- Ground content in `GOALS.md`, `SCOPE.md`, and `CONVENTIONS.md`.
- For ADRs under `adr/`, use `create-architectural-decision-record` instead of general documentation skills.
